/** Each (effector: nested effects go after the parameters). Applies the effects nested in it to every element separately (Clone copies, letters, tiles…), with formulas that read the element: element.index, element.count, element.row and element.column (grid), element.u and element.v (0–1 across the grid), element.distance (0 at the centre of the elements, 1 for the furthest) and element.random (a fixed 0–1 number per element; Random seed varies it). For example, Each › Transform with scale = 1 - element.distance. A Shape inside it rebuilds each copy with other values for the shape's own parameters. */
