/** Shape. Only inside Each, on a shape object after a Clone: rebuilds every copy with other values for the shape's own parameters, by name, usually formulas with element.* (Inner = 19 * (1 - element.distance) closes the holes of a donut grid towards the edges). The new copy keeps its place and style. */
